# Game domain

- Pull/offence/defence, field side, halftime, mixed gender caps: `calculatePointInfo` in `src/utils.ts`.
- Lineup columns: `splitPlayers` (Mixed / Open / Women rules differ).
- Lines are **7 players** (`points.playerIds` length 7).
- Event types: `EventType` enum in `src/database/schema.ts` (`SCORE`, `PASS`, `BLOCK`, etc.).
- Changing rules requires updating `src/utils.test.ts`.
